    "structure": "New closed rebated annular window frame; shouldered/crowned deep sash bones, real rear half-laps and seated transverse bones; receiver moved from100mm to222mm depth. Real crowned/raised-head eased girts, independently recessed transom boarding and stile depth. Camera/window centres retained.",
