    "light": "Original sun8, courtyard patch powers440/180, their positions, reference/inspection camera and exposure1.35 retained. Two actual solid-angle-integrated near measured low-sky sector lights cast geometry shadows; residual hemisphere.025/environment.14. Same actual128px6-face temple/finite-court probe at[5.5,6.4,7.2] supplies explicit.22 wood response and existing metal roles. Both sky and cube are explicitly PMREM-filtered before material draws. Local raster/sector approximations, not traced GI.",
